    "html": "<p>A small block is accelerated from rest along a horizontal track. The graph shows the variation with displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span> of the square of the velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v^2\"></span> of the block.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the acceleration of the block?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0 \\text{ m s}^{-2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0 \\text{ m s}^{-2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0 \\text{ m s}^{-2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0 \\text{ m s}^{-2}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
